// the bills, the software route, the board of our own, the radio, the words
// and the sources. site/js/review.js only draws it; test/review.test.js checks it.
//
// Where a fact comes from: every computer and every claim names the research
// reports it rests on (ids in `reports`, the files in docs/hardware-review/
// research/). A link was either in one of those reports, already in this
// repository, or opened for this page on 11 or 13 November 2026.
//
// Prices are Australian dollars. `aud` is one figure including GST for sorting,
// or null when no price could be read: the page then says "check with the
// seller". Overseas prices are converted at the site's planning rates
// (US$0.69 and EUR 0.63 to the dollar) and say so.
//
// In a text, {{id|words}} marks words whose meaning is in `terms` (the page
// shows it on hover and in its list of meanings) and **words** is bold.
//
// Speed is "times a Raspberry Pi 4": `all` for the whole computer, `core` for
// one core. Every figure is a stand-in from published benchmarks of other
// software until firmware/bench has been run on the real computer.

