        how: 'The utility\'s security team works to those rules and applies the same questions down the list, often led by the people who run the plant\'s control systems. To them an {{iec62443|IEC 62443}} certificate carries real weight; Australia adopted it as an Australian Standard in July 2025.',
        asks: ['Who can reach the box from outside the organisation, and from which country? "Offshore or remote access" is a risk the rules name.', 'Who owns the supplier, and what access and control does the supplier have?', 'How is it patched in time, and what happens when a part is no longer supported?', 'Is it on a separated network, with its traffic logged?'],
